references:08c9d8b7-af8413-45e16f-746e5f49b3f9-1 evid:biblio "Goldberg, Adele E. 1995. Constructions: A Construction Grammar Approach to Argument Structure. University of Chicago Press." .

references:08c9d8b7-af8413-45e16f-746e5f49b3f9-2 evid:biblio "Ramezani, Pegah, Achim Schilling & Patrick Krauss. 2025. Analysis of argument structure constructions in a deep recurrent language model. Frontiers in Computational Neuroscience. Frontiers 19. https://doi.org/10.3389/fncom.2025.1474860." .

references:08c9d8b7-af8413-45e16f-746e5f49b3f9-3 evid:biblio "Ramezani, Pegah, Achim Schilling & Patrick Krauss. 2025. Analysis of argument structure constructions in the large language model BERT. Frontiers in Artificial Intelligence 8. 1477246. https://doi.org/10.3389/frai.2025.1477246." .

references:08c9d8b7-af8413-45e16f-746e5f49b3f9-4 evid:biblio "Ramezani, Pegah, Thomas Kinfe, Andreas Maier, Achim Schilling & Patrick Krauss. 2026. Convergent representations of linguistic constructions in human and artificial neural systems. Frontiers in Language Sciences. Frontiers 5. https://doi.org/10.3389/flang.2026.1846406." .

